## Core pages
- [Home]({{ site.url | safe }}/): clan overview, current stats, and roster snapshot
- [Roster]({{ site.url | safe }}/roster/): live member table with roles, trophies, career wins, years played, and collection score, sortable by any column
- [Data]({{ site.url | safe }}/data/): interactive roster explorer (plot the roster on any two metrics) and a clan timeline over the whole tracked history
- [Recognition]({{ site.url | safe }}/recognition/): completed War Champ, Iron King, Rookie MVP, Donation Champ, and clan-funded Pass Royale results
- [Elixir]({{ site.url | safe }}/elixir/): the POAP KINGS clan agent that runs recognition and the weekly Elder Standing, tells the clan's story, and coaches members
- [Elixir Drop]({{ site.url | safe }}/elixir-drop/): the free browser game for learning Clash Royale card elixir costs through six fast, replayable modes
- [Elixir Drop game modes](https://drop.poapkings.com/games/): how Practice, Surge, Higher / Lower, Trade, Survival, and Rain work
- [Learn elixir costs](https://drop.poapkings.com/learn-elixir-costs/): recall, recognition, elixir trades, and a simple training routine
- [Elixir Drop badges](https://drop.poapkings.com/badges/): public badge ladders and milestones
- [Elixir Drop Free Pass Challenge]({{ site.url | safe }}/elixir-drop/free-pass/): reusable competition eligibility, scoring, Fair Play, and Pass Royale delivery rules
- [Members hub]({{ site.url | safe }}/members/): setup guide, how Elder is earned, and promotion tools for current members
- [Setup guide]({{ site.url | safe }}/members/setup/): how to connect with leadership, join Discord, and register for the roster
- [FAQ]({{ site.url | safe }}/faq/): clan, Clan Wars, recognition, Free Pass Royale, Discord, and role questions

